## Example: (Verifier) Check that the opened quotient value is correct

At this stage, the user requests to check that

  `folded_constraints(zeta) / Z_H(zeta) = quotient(zeta)`.

### Prompt

Check that the `quotient`, opened value of quotient polynomial at `zeta`, is correct;
  use `constraints`, the value of folded contraints polynomial at `zeta`,
  and `sels`, the selector polynomials evaluated in point `zeta`.

### Inputs

```rust
